SOAPBOX: First night, conditions were good until thunderstorms started in the Caribbean, and propagation brought them to me. Receive antenna helped, but many did not hear me. Second night, conditions were much worse, and I had worked most everyone I could hear, so was very unproductive.
SOAPBOX: The furthest station I heard was CO, and he could not hear me and he always had many callers. Also heard RI, but he did not hear me.
SOAPBOX: Equipment: K3 @5W, Inverted-L, 500 foot receive beverage terminated towards the west.
